      <rule>Page objects are TypeScript classes taking \`page: Page\`; expose locators as getters.</rule>
      <rule>Use \`getByLabel\`/\`getByRole\`/\`getByTestId\` for the matching strategies; raw \`page.locator\` only for css/xpath.</rule>
      <rule>Use web-first assertions (\`await expect(locator).toBeVisible()\`); never \`waitForTimeout\`.</rule>
    </rules>
    <verification>
